OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'loving and
OL,4,Acaring' man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died following
OL,7,Fa collision with a lorry have described
OL,8,Fhim as a "loving, caring, son, brother
OL,9,Fand devoted dog dad".
OL,11,FCraig Harrison, 34, died following a
OL,12,Fcollision with a lorry on the A1067 at
OL,13,FKettlestone, near Fakenham, Norfolk, on
OL,14,F4 November.
OL,16,FIn a tribute, his family said he had
OL,17,Fspent many years as an English teacher
OL,18,Fin South Korea and had travelled around
OL,19,FAsia, while still following his home
OL,20,Ffootball team the Canaries.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
