OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'loving and
OL,4,Acaring' man
OL,5,
OL,6,F"On returning to his home county of
OL,7,FNorfolk with his best friend Maple,
OL,8,FCraig adjusted to rural life and
OL,9,Fenjoyed dog walks on the Norfolk coast
OL,10,Fand country parks," his family said.
